OL,3,ABurnham pressed on economy at first
OL,4,APMQs as borrowing costs surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham said his government would
OL,7,Fbe "grounded in fiscal responsibility"
OL,8,Fas his first Prime Minister's Questions
OL,9,Ftook place against a backdrop of rising
OL,10,FUK borrowing costs.
OL,12,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,13,Fcalled on Burnham to say where spending
OL,14,Fwould be cut and how he would deal with
OL,15,Fthe UK's increasing debt, after the
OL,16,Fcost of borrowing for the UK reached a
OL,17,Fnew 18-year high on Wednesday.
OL,19,FHe blamed the previous Tory government,
OL,20,Fsaying the "turbulence on global
OL,21,Fmarkets are because of that exposure
OL,22,Fthat they left behind".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
